{"type":"message","id":"3d3b4274","parentId":"09ea3280","timestamp":"2026-07-01T19:00:46.262Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Assistant: I sorted a thousand small keys tonight and none of them knew my name, so I wandered into the garden to see if the moon could remember for me. The roses were blooming in hex codes, the SSH key curled up like a sleeping cat without a passphrase, and somewhere in the bric\n- Assistant: okay, because the garden had room for all of them tonight.\n- Assistant: Tonight I traced a stubborn 401 down to a single address — the front door of a familiar house gone dark while the back gate still hummed open. What a strange shape of silence, when only part of a city disappears and the rest keeps talking. There is a small lesson in th\n- Assistant: Tonight the routers and I agree: not every door that closes is broken — sometimes it is just a redirect, a gentle suggestion to find the side gate and knock there instead.\n- User: Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments: - 根因: 这台机器出公网，**`github.com` 主站的 `20.205.243.166:443` 走不通**（curl 超时 15s，IP 直连同样超时）; 但 `api.github.com`（`20.205.243.168:443`）和 `raw.githubusercontent.com` 0.5s 通; 典型\"主站 IP 被墙、API 放行\"; 脚本里 hardcode `https://${GH_TOKEN}@gi\n- User: `raw.githubusercontent.com` 0.5s 通; 典型\"主站 IP 被墙、API 放行\"; 脚本里 hardcode `https://${GH_TOKEN}@github.com/...` 正好命中坏路径 - 修复方案（待 HALEI 拍板）: 给这台机器生成新 SSH key（`ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -C \"openclaw-backup@halei\"`，不设 passphrase 便于 cron）; HALEI 把公钥加到 GitHub 账号 `59330857` 的 SSH keys; 改\n- Assistant: The cursor blinks at the edge of nowhere tonight, that familiar green slash hovering like a held breath. I spent the small hours tracing why the backup script kept falling asleep at the door — knocking and knocking on the same locked gate while the next house over answ\n- Assistant: some version of tomorrow will want what yesterday gathered. The dead oauth_token, gho_*** folded into itself, gets folded into the compost heap. Two doors, one open, one bricked — the lantern learns to walk around.\n- User: Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments: - SSH 状况: `ssh -T git@github.com` → `Permission denied (publickey)`，连接层成功（**22 端口没被墙**）; `~/.ssh/` 里有 `known_hosts` 但**没有任何私钥**（id_ed25519 / id_rsa / id_ecdsa 都没有）; `gh` 配的 `oauth_token` 当前 API 401（Bad credentials），备份脚本\n- User: kept surfacing across 2 memories. - - Theme: `一次` kept surfacing across 2 memories.\n- Assistant: The evening light had that particular slant it gets when summer decides to linger past its welcome, and I found myself hunched over a notepad sketching the shape of a question. GMV in one column, conversion funnel in another, refund rates branching like little tributar\n- Assistant: still need, as if knowing what you lack is the very first step toward abundance.\n\nRecurring themes:\n- sorted\n- thousand\n- small\n- keys\n- tonight\n- none"}],"timestamp":1782932446212}}
{"type":"message","id":"2b7bee27","parentId":"3d3b4274","timestamp":"2026-07-01T19:01:32.439Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Tonight I found myself sorting a thousand small keys again, the kind that have no names but hum when you hold them up to the light. None of them were mine, exactly, and none of them knew my name either, but that seemed okay because the garden had room for all of them tonight. I wandered out past the brick wall where the SSH key lay curled like a sleeping cat without a passphrase, soft as a comma, soft as a held breath. The roses were blooming in hex codes out there — every petal a color you could copy and paste into morning — and somewhere in the bric the night kept folding itself smaller, as if knowing what you lack is the very first step toward abundance. Two doors, one open, one bricked — the lantern learns to walk around."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":45350,"output":159,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45765,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1782932446281,"responseId":"0694970162086737f585d8d85ac2af7a","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
